00:10:46.059 --> 00:10:47.059
No rules.

00:10:47.059 --> 00:10:48.709
It means there's no rules, you guys.

00:10:48.709 --> 00:10:49.709
Nothing makes sense.

00:10:49.709 --> 00:10:54.990
That means that Ant-Man's real power isn't
getting bigger and smaller, it's just doing

00:10:54.990 --> 00:10:57.029
whatever needs to happen in the movie.

00:10:57.029 --> 00:11:00.790
And I think that that is the ultimate power.

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:06.240
Well, Tom, that's pretty good, but I really
do wish that you had prepared a little bit

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:07.240
better.

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:08.240
Yeah.

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:09.240
Kind of embarrassing, dude.

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:12.170
Nina and I came locked and loaded with our
answers.

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:18.519
And I just feel like it's kind of unprofessional
that you would come here without having prepared

00:11:18.519 --> 00:11:19.519
as well as we did.

00:11:19.519 --> 00:11:21.399
I don't know why you hired this guy.

00:11:21.399 --> 00:11:23.500
He clearly doesn't know anything about the
MCU.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:25.670
I mean, I believe in second chances.

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:32.089
So, Tom, next time I want you to try a little
bit harder to be ready to go.

00:11:32.089 --> 00:11:33.670
Okay?

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:36.829
All right.

00:11:36.829 --> 00:11:39.990
Bye, Tom.

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:40.990
Thanks for joining us.

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:44.249
